WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.692 --> 00:00:14.799
"What are things doing here?"

2
00:00:15.219 --> 00:00:19.642
Zann thought as he stared at the gorzog that had just tried to attack Perda.

3
00:00:20.382 --> 00:00:22.964
It had crashed into the dirt when it missed its target.

4
00:00:23.684 --> 00:00:27.567
Now it rolled over, growling with frustration, and climbed back to its feet.

5
00:00:27.587 --> 00:00:28.867
"Look out!"

6
00:00:29.187 --> 00:00:29.768
Perda shouted.

7
00:00:30.428 --> 00:00:33.711
Zann spun around and saw another gorzog running toward them.

8
00:00:35.052 --> 00:00:39.656
He and Perda leaped aside, and the creature passed between them, crashing into the first one.

9
00:00:40.236 --> 00:00:44.600
Meanwhile Zann noticed a third gorzog peering out the farmhouse door.

10
00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:46.781
"We have to get out of here!"

11
00:00:47.082 --> 00:00:47.962
he called to Perda.

12
00:00:47.982 --> 00:00:49.243
"Grab my hand!"

13
00:00:49.964 --> 00:00:55.268
All three gorzogs charged, slime dripping from their curved teeth and ugly snouts.

14
00:00:56.029 --> 00:01:01.045
The one from the house jumped out and landed in between Zann and Perda, turning one way and

15
00:01:01.085 --> 00:01:04.006
then the other as if wondering whom to attack first.

16
00:01:04.746 --> 00:01:07.467
Zing whistled in fear while zipping around overhead.

17
00:01:08.168 --> 00:01:13.310
Zann realized there was no way he could get to Perda before the gorzogs got to both of

18
00:01:13.350 --> 00:01:15.391
them. "Just zap!"

19
00:01:15.891 --> 00:01:18.052
she called, already rubbing her hands together.

20
00:01:18.072 --> 00:01:20.873
"Meet me in front of Zira's house!"

21
00:01:21.774 --> 00:01:22.514
Zann nodded.

22
00:01:23.034 --> 00:01:28.601
As Perda zapped out of sight, he reached up and grabbed Zing, snapping his fingers with the other

23
00:01:28.641 --> 00:01:29.821
hand to create friction.

24
00:01:29.841 --> 00:01:31.721
"Zap!" he cried.

25
00:01:33.182 --> 00:01:38.463
Splash! Zann landed in a fancy stone fountain inside a large room.

26
00:01:39.404 --> 00:01:43.105
Zing muttered and spit out water and steam as Zann looked around.

27
00:01:43.125 --> 00:01:46.706
"Uh-oh," he thought as he recognized the room.

28
00:01:47.406 --> 00:01:49.887
"I tried to zap in front of Zira's house like Perda said.

29
00:01:50.507 --> 00:01:53.027
But instead I zapped inside her house!"

30
00:01:53.768 --> 00:01:57.373
The room was deserted, but Zann heard voices coming closer.

31
00:01:58.094 --> 00:02:02.116
He jumped out of the fountain, grabbed Zing, and hid behind a piece of furniture.

32
00:02:02.136 --> 00:02:06.118
"Oops," he thought as he saw the wet footsteps he'd left behind.

33
00:02:06.879 --> 00:02:09.820
He quickly snapped his fingers and used magic to dry them.

34
00:02:10.781 --> 00:02:13.922
A second later Vilkor and Mellis stepped into the room.

35
00:02:13.943 --> 00:02:16.344
"Uncle, please listen to me!"

36
00:02:16.744 --> 00:02:17.545
Mellis was saying.

37
00:02:18.265 --> 00:02:23.528
Zann realized that the pair must have zapped into the house at about the same time he had.

38
00:02:24.296 --> 00:02:27.539
Vilkor's eyes swept the room, but he didn't spot Zann.

39
00:02:27.559 --> 00:02:28.880
"Where is Zira?"

40
00:02:29.240 --> 00:02:29.701
he snapped.

41
00:02:30.261 --> 00:02:33.344
"She won't be pleased to hear about your disloyalty, niece!"

42
00:02:34.104 --> 00:02:35.205
He glared at Mellis.

43
00:02:35.926 --> 00:02:39.549
"Why couldn't you just go along with our plans?

44
00:02:40.269 --> 00:02:45.434
We have a good thing going here—it's everything we've ever wanted!"

45
00:02:45.454 --> 00:02:48.997
"No, it's everything you wanted!"

46
00:02:49.377 --> 00:02:49.897
Mellis said.

47
00:02:49.917 --> 00:02:52.640
"I don't care about power and glory.

48
00:02:53.192 --> 00:02:57.313
All I want is a peaceful land where everyone can use magic to create what they need."

49
00:02:57.853 --> 00:02:58.754
Vilkor frowned.

50
00:02:58.774 --> 00:03:02.655
"But then I wouldn't have any more power than anyone else."

51
00:03:02.675 --> 00:03:05.075
"Exactly," Mellis said.

52
00:03:05.095 --> 00:03:06.556
"What's wrong with that?"

53
00:03:07.256 --> 00:03:08.456
Vilkor rolled his eyes.

54
00:03:08.476 --> 00:03:11.777
"You don't understand," he said.

55
00:03:11.797 --> 00:03:15.418
"You remind me more and more of your mother.

56
00:03:16.239 --> 00:03:18.119
She was always a do-gooder too.

57
00:03:18.739 --> 00:03:21.100
But I won't let you ruin this for me!"

58
00:03:22.368 --> 00:03:25.669
Before Mellis could respond, Zira zapped into the room.

59
00:03:26.309 --> 00:03:29.850
Krub was with her, along with a pair of hideous gorzogs.

60
00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:31.491
Vilkor gasped.

61
00:03:31.511 --> 00:03:32.431
"Look out!

62
00:03:32.631 --> 00:03:36.792
Gorzogs!" Zira smirked, seeming to enjoy his fear.

63
00:03:36.812 --> 00:03:43.734
"That's right," she said, holding up one hand and examining her own purple-stained fingers.

64
00:03:43.754 --> 00:03:49.436
"I've discovered yet another useful application of my otherworld potions.

65
00:03:50.308 --> 00:03:56.653
I've figured out how to use their extra power to tame these fearsome beasts and bend them to

66
00:03:56.733 --> 00:03:57.594
my will."

67
00:03:58.675 --> 00:03:59.996
Zann's eyes widened.

68
00:04:00.016 --> 00:04:01.677
"The oogberries!"

69
00:04:02.018 --> 00:04:04.319
he thought, glancing toward the nearest window.

70
00:04:05.280 --> 00:04:10.204
Through it, he caught a glimpse of the courtyard where the purple-berried bushes were growing.

71
00:04:10.224 --> 00:04:13.487
"Perda was right," he told himself grimly.

72
00:04:13.507 --> 00:04:18.270
"Zira wants to use the berries' power to make herself even more powerful."

73
00:04:19.131 --> 00:04:19.952
Krub snickered.

74
00:04:22.581 --> 00:04:25.782
"Don't worry, Vilkor," he said mockingly.

75
00:04:25.802 --> 00:04:31.843
"The gorzogs won't hurt you as long as you obey your supreme ruler—Zira."

76
00:04:31.863 --> 00:04:37.825
"What?" Vilkor frowned, seeming to forget about the gorzogs for a second.

77
00:04:38.505 --> 00:04:40.086
He took a step toward the other two.

78
00:04:40.106 --> 00:04:42.206
"Hold on one second.

79
00:04:42.966 --> 00:04:46.607
Have you forgotten that I'm the supreme ruler?"

80
00:04:47.448 --> 00:04:48.708
Zira snapped her fingers.

81
00:04:49.376 --> 00:04:53.618
One of the gorzogs crept closer, its eyes locked on Vilkor.

82
00:04:54.098 --> 00:04:54.938
Vilkor gulped.

83
00:04:55.639 --> 00:04:58.780
"Er, on the other hand, there's no need to be hasty."

84
00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:00.421
He took a step back.

85
00:05:01.141 --> 00:05:04.882
"When I said I was the supreme ruler, I meant we, of course.

86
00:05:05.403 --> 00:05:07.223
We're all in this together, a team.

87
00:05:07.643 --> 00:05:10.124
We're, um, partners, right?"

88
00:05:11.105 --> 00:05:12.505
Zira looked disdainful.

89
00:05:12.525 --> 00:05:16.187
"Are you really that feeble-minded, Vilkor?

90
00:05:17.227 --> 00:05:18.508
I suppose you are.

91
00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:22.884
After all, you don't even realize when you're being spied on.

92
00:05:23.684 --> 00:05:27.888
Otherwise you never would have dared to call me what was it?

93
00:05:28.449 --> 00:05:30.491
Your assistant?"

94
00:05:31.491 --> 00:05:36.296
Zann realized Zira must have seen what Vilkor had said to the mountain villagers.

95
00:05:36.316 --> 00:05:37.637
"But how?"

96
00:05:38.057 --> 00:05:38.458
he thought.

97
00:05:38.478 --> 00:05:40.800
"Did she discover spy flies?

98
00:05:41.220 --> 00:05:43.883
Or His gaze wandered back to the window.

99
00:05:43.903 --> 00:05:44.824
"I know!

100
00:05:45.276 --> 00:05:49.519
It's probably another otherworld trick she invented using those oogberries."

101
00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:56.344
He forgot about that when Zira's nose twitched, and then she turned to stare toward his hiding place.

102
00:05:56.364 --> 00:06:02.889
"Ah, and it seems you're being spied on again right now," she said to Vilkor.

103
00:06:02.909 --> 00:06:04.490
"We both are.

104
00:06:05.091 --> 00:06:06.352
But not for long."

105
00:06:07.072 --> 00:06:11.616
Raising one hand, she made a beckoning gesture with her purple-stained fingers.

106
00:06:12.232 --> 00:06:17.053
Zann couldn't help crying out as he felt himself being magically lifted into the air.

107
00:06:17.654 --> 00:06:20.554
He floated out of his hiding place toward Zira.

108
00:06:20.574 --> 00:06:24.155
"It's you," she hissed when she recognized him.

109
00:06:24.175 --> 00:06:27.496
"This time I'll make sure you don't escape.

110
00:06:28.137 --> 00:06:31.678
Immobilize!" Zann felt his limbs go numb.

111
00:06:31.698 --> 00:06:33.278
"Zing, quick!"

112
00:06:33.838 --> 00:06:37.779
he croaked out, seconds before the spell took away his ability to speak.

113
00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:39.580
"The berries!"

114
00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:42.661
Luckily the little dragon understood.

115
00:06:43.221 --> 00:06:49.604
As Zann felt himself go motionless, Zing sprang into action, flying out the window and spitting fire.

116
00:06:50.624 --> 00:06:57.367
Zann's face was already immobilized, so he couldn't even smile as he saw the oogberry bushes burst into

117
00:06:57.427 --> 00:06:57.967
flames.
